{"lines": [{"text": "Imagine you wake up one morning, and your body has simply... stopped aging.", "start": 0.8, "end": 6.752, "spec": {"shot": "wake", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Imagine", 0.091, 0.482], ["you", 0.495, 0.612], ["wake", 0.612, 0.872], ["up", 0.885, 1.107], ["one", 1.12, 1.406], ["morning", 1.406, 1.901], ["and", 2.318, 2.461], ["your", 2.474, 2.578], ["body", 2.578, 3.06], ["has", 3.06, 3.294], ["simply", 3.307, 4.102], ["stopped", 4.557, 5.039], ["aging", 5.052, 5.586]]}, {"text": "No wrinkles. No gray hair. No back pain. Ever.", "start": 7.302, "end": 11.958, "spec": {"shot": "mirror", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.091, 0.247], ["wrinkles", 0.247, 1.016], ["No", 1.445, 1.667], ["gray", 1.667, 1.953], ["hair", 1.953, 2.37], ["No", 2.773, 2.917], ["back", 2.917, 3.164], ["pain", 3.164, 3.49], ["Ever", 3.919, 4.284]]}, {"text": "At first, this is the best thing that has ever happened to you. You're basically a superhero.", "start": 12.508, "end": 18.412, "spec": {"shot": "hype", "era": "wonder", "chip": "DAY 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.104, 0.208], ["first", 0.208, 0.82], ["this", 1.094, 1.263], ["is", 1.263, 1.354], ["the", 1.354, 1.471], ["best", 1.484, 1.849], ["thing", 1.862, 2.109], ["that", 2.122, 2.214], ["has", 2.214, 2.422], ["ever", 2.565, 2.786], ["happened", 2.786, 3.151], ["to", 3.164, 3.281], ["you", 3.281, 3.529], ["You're", 3.945, 4.036], ["basically", 4.05, 4.57], ["a", 4.57, 4.635], ["superhero", 4.648, 5.521]]}, {"text": "This is your life if you never aged.", "start": 18.962, "end": 21.362, "spec": {"shot": "title", "era": "title", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["This", 0.104, 0.312], ["is", 0.312, 0.404], ["your", 0.404, 0.508], ["life", 0.508, 0.964], ["if", 1.029, 1.12], ["you", 1.12, 1.198], ["never", 1.198, 1.549], ["aged", 1.55, 2.005]]}, {"text": "The first thing you notice is that the pressure is gone. No more, I'm getting too old for this. No ticking clock. Ever.", "start": 21.912, "end": 29.904, "spec": {"shot": "nopressure", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.117, 0.169], ["first", 0.182, 0.456], ["thing", 0.456, 0.599], ["you", 0.599, 0.69], ["notice", 0.703, 1.289], ["is", 1.471, 1.602], ["that", 1.602, 1.719], ["the", 1.732, 1.823], ["pressure", 1.823, 2.266], ["is", 2.279, 2.383], ["gone", 2.383, 2.773], ["No", 3.203, 3.32], ["more", 3.333, 3.698], ["I'm", 4.219, 4.284], ["getting", 4.284, 4.479], ["too", 4.492, 4.701], ["old", 4.701, 4.883], ["for", 4.883, 5.013], ["this", 5.026, 5.443], ["No", 5.859, 6.016], ["ticking", 6.016, 6.445], ["clock", 6.458, 6.836], ["Ever", 7.253, 7.604]]}, {"text": "You sleep in. You take a year off. Nobody can tell you that you're wasting your life, because you literally can't.", "start": 30.454, "end": 37.438, "spec": {"shot": "sleepin", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 1 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.104, 0.169], ["sleep", 0.182, 0.469], ["in", 0.469, 0.69], ["You", 1.12, 1.159], ["take", 1.159, 1.315], ["a", 1.315, 1.341], ["year", 1.341, 1.576], ["off", 1.576, 1.927], ["Nobody", 2.344, 2.656], ["can", 2.656, 2.812], ["tell", 2.812, 3.099], ["you", 3.099, 3.268], ["that", 3.281, 3.385], ["you're", 3.385, 3.542], ["wasting", 3.542, 3.997], ["your", 4.01, 4.141], ["life", 4.141, 4.622], ["because", 4.909, 5.26], ["you", 5.26, 5.404], ["literally", 5.417, 6.068], ["can't", 6.081, 6.615]]}, {"text": "So you learn everything. French. Then Spanish. Then Japanese.", "start": 37.988, "end": 43.484, "spec": {"shot": "learn", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 2 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.104, 0.208], ["you", 0.221, 0.391], ["learn", 0.391, 0.638], ["everything", 0.651, 1.25], ["French", 1.745, 2.174], ["Then", 2.617, 2.839], ["Spanish", 2.852, 3.542], ["Then", 3.958, 4.154], ["Japanese", 4.271, 5.104]]}, {"text": "You learn the piano, the guitar, and how to cook pretty much anything. You read every book you ever wanted to read.", "start": 44.034, "end": 51.306, "spec": {"shot": "skills", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 4 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.195], ["learn", 0.208, 0.365], ["the", 0.365, 0.443], ["piano", 0.456, 1.107], ["the", 1.315, 1.406], ["guitar", 1.419, 1.953], ["and", 2.526, 2.578], ["how", 2.591, 2.695], ["to", 2.695, 2.786], ["cook", 2.786, 3.008], ["pretty", 3.008, 3.242], ["much", 3.255, 3.49], ["anything", 3.503, 3.971], ["You", 4.388, 4.544], ["read", 4.544, 4.909], ["every", 5.195, 5.456], ["book", 5.456, 5.729], ["you", 5.729, 5.924], ["ever", 6.081, 6.315], ["wanted", 6.315, 6.51], ["to", 6.51, 6.549], ["read", 6.55, 6.888]]}, {"text": "You travel to every single country on Earth. Not on some rushed two-week vacation. You live in each one for a while.", "start": 51.856, "end": 59.08, "spec": {"shot": "travel", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 6 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.169], ["travel", 0.182, 0.625], ["to", 0.625, 0.768], ["every", 0.938, 1.276], ["single", 1.289, 1.589], ["country", 1.602, 1.927], ["on", 1.94, 2.083], ["Earth", 2.083, 2.461], ["Not", 2.891, 3.073], ["on", 3.086, 3.242], ["some", 3.242, 3.464], ["rushed", 3.464, 3.841], ["two-week", 3.854, 4.362], ["vacation", 4.375, 5.013], ["You", 5.443, 5.521], ["live", 5.521, 5.664], ["in", 5.664, 5.755], ["each", 5.755, 5.898], ["one", 5.911, 6.159], ["for", 6.159, 6.315], ["a", 6.315, 6.367], ["while", 6.367, 6.823]]}, {"text": "You take every risk. Start a business, fail, start another one. Who cares? You can try again a hundred times.", "start": 59.63, "end": 67.838, "spec": {"shot": "risks", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 7 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.104, 0.182], ["take", 0.182, 0.43], ["every", 0.56, 0.859], ["risk", 0.859, 1.328], ["Start", 1.732, 1.979], ["a", 1.992, 2.044], ["business", 2.044, 2.734], ["fail", 2.956, 3.477], ["start", 3.763, 3.984], ["another", 3.997, 4.271], ["one", 4.284, 4.557], ["Who", 4.974, 5.078], ["cares", 5.078, 5.664], ["You", 6.094, 6.146], ["can", 6.146, 6.224], ["try", 6.224, 6.497], ["again", 6.51, 6.823], ["a", 6.823, 6.849], ["hundred", 6.849, 7.201], ["times", 7.201, 7.826]]}, {"text": "Want to be a doctor, a pilot and a chef? Easy. Just become all of them, one after another.", "start": 68.388, "end": 75.732, "spec": {"shot": "careers", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Want", 0.091, 0.182], ["to", 0.182, 0.221], ["be", 0.221, 0.339], ["a", 0.339, 0.391], ["doctor", 0.391, 0.938], ["a", 1.406, 1.458], ["pilot", 1.836, 2.396], ["and", 2.539, 2.656], ["a", 2.656, 2.682], ["chef", 2.695, 3.242], ["Easy", 3.659, 4.089], ["Just", 4.518, 4.622], ["become", 4.622, 4.909], ["all", 4.922, 5.182], ["of", 5.195, 5.299], ["them", 5.3, 5.547], ["one", 6.003, 6.25], ["after", 6.25, 6.55], ["another", 6.55, 6.979]]}, {"text": "You even put a little money into the stock market and just leave it there. When you have decades to wait, compound interest becomes your best friend.", "start": 76.282, "end": 84.874, "spec": {"shot": "invest", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 8 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.169], ["even", 0.169, 0.352], ["put", 0.352, 0.456], ["a", 0.469, 0.534], ["little", 0.547, 0.885], ["money", 0.885, 1.263], ["into", 1.263, 1.406], ["the", 1.406, 1.484], ["stock", 1.484, 1.862], ["market", 1.862, 2.279], ["and", 2.643, 2.747], ["just", 2.747, 2.943], ["leave", 2.943, 3.151], ["it", 3.151, 3.229], ["there", 3.229, 3.581], ["When", 4.01, 4.089], ["you", 4.089, 4.206], ["have", 4.206, 4.531], ["decades", 4.661, 5.13], ["to", 5.13, 5.221], ["wait", 5.221, 5.599], ["compound", 5.898, 6.445], ["interest", 6.51, 6.966], ["becomes", 6.966, 7.318], ["your", 7.318, 7.422], ["best", 7.435, 7.786], ["friend", 7.786, 8.203]]}, {"text": "Your friends are jealous. What's your secret, they ask. And you just smile.", "start": 85.424, "end": 90.368, "spec": {"shot": "envy", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.091, 0.169], ["friends", 0.169, 0.586], ["are", 0.599, 0.716], ["jealous", 0.716, 1.419], ["What's", 1.836, 1.979], ["your", 1.979, 2.083], ["secret", 2.083, 2.565], ["they", 2.591, 2.747], ["ask", 2.76, 3.268], ["And", 3.698, 3.75], ["you", 3.763, 3.867], ["just", 3.867, 4.089], ["smile", 4.089, 4.57]]}, {"text": "Life is perfect. You feel like you've beaten the game.", "start": 90.918, "end": 94.086, "spec": {"shot": "king", "era": "modern", "chip": "YEAR 9 · AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Life", 0.104, 0.352], ["is", 0.352, 0.443], ["perfect", 0.456, 1.029], ["You", 1.458, 1.549], ["feel", 1.55, 1.706], ["like", 1.706, 1.862], ["you've", 1.862, 2.044], ["beaten", 2.057, 2.305], ["the", 2.318, 2.396], ["game", 2.396, 2.799]]}, {"text": "But then, slowly, the problems start.", "start": 94.636, "end": 97.54, "spec": {"shot": "problems", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.117, 0.221], ["then", 0.234, 0.482], ["slowly", 0.911, 1.549], ["the", 1.562, 1.654], ["problems", 1.654, 2.083], ["start", 2.096, 2.513]]}, {"text": "Ten years later, your friends start to notice. They have their first wrinkles and their first gray hairs. You look exactly the same.", "start": 98.09, "end": 106.802, "spec": {"shot": "tenyears", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 10 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Ten", 0.104, 0.339], ["years", 0.339, 0.599], ["later", 0.612, 1.042], ["your", 1.458, 1.562], ["friends", 1.562, 1.94], ["start", 1.94, 2.135], ["to", 2.135, 2.187], ["notice", 2.201, 2.813], ["They", 3.242, 3.294], ["have", 3.294, 3.411], ["their", 3.425, 3.555], ["first", 3.555, 4.01], ["wrinkles", 4.023, 4.753], ["and", 4.922, 5.039], ["their", 5.039, 5.156], ["first", 5.156, 5.664], ["gray", 5.677, 6.029], ["hairs", 6.029, 6.654], ["You", 7.083, 7.161], ["look", 7.161, 7.279], ["exactly", 7.279, 7.812], ["the", 7.812, 7.904], ["same", 7.917, 8.346]]}, {"text": "At first they joke about it. Then they stop joking. People start whispering behind your back.", "start": 107.352, "end": 113.064, "spec": {"shot": "whisper", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 12 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.104, 0.182], ["first", 0.195, 0.495], ["they", 0.495, 0.612], ["joke", 0.625, 0.924], ["about", 0.924, 1.198], ["it", 1.211, 1.354], ["Then", 1.771, 1.849], ["they", 1.849, 1.94], ["stop", 1.953, 2.292], ["joking", 2.305, 2.826], ["People", 3.255, 3.516], ["start", 3.516, 3.776], ["whispering", 3.776, 4.336], ["behind", 4.427, 4.779], ["your", 4.779, 4.87], ["back", 4.87, 5.326]]}, {"text": "Your best friend turns forty and throws a huge party. And you still get asked for your ID at the door.", "start": 113.614, "end": 120.286, "spec": {"shot": "party40", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 15 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.091, 0.182], ["best", 0.195, 0.482], ["friend", 0.495, 0.859], ["turns", 0.964, 1.263], ["forty", 1.263, 1.875], ["and", 2.083, 2.279], ["throws", 2.474, 2.865], ["a", 2.865, 2.904], ["huge", 2.904, 3.411], ["party", 3.425, 3.802], ["And", 4.232, 4.297], ["you", 4.297, 4.362], ["still", 4.375, 4.596], ["get", 4.596, 4.74], ["asked", 4.74, 5.026], ["for", 5.026, 5.13], ["your", 5.13, 5.286], ["ID", 5.286, 5.677], ["at", 5.69, 5.768], ["the", 5.768, 5.859], ["door", 5.859, 6.276]]}, {"text": "So you start lying. Botox. Great genes. A really strict skincare routine. And every lie needs another lie.", "start": 120.836, "end": 129.356, "spec": {"shot": "lies", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 14 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.195], ["you", 0.208, 0.299], ["start", 0.312, 0.638], ["lying", 0.651, 1.068], ["Botox", 1.471, 2.148], ["Great", 2.578, 2.839], ["genes", 2.839, 3.451], ["A", 3.867, 3.932], ["really", 3.945, 4.232], ["strict", 4.232, 4.687], ["skincare", 4.688, 5.234], ["routine", 5.234, 5.742], ["And", 6.159, 6.302], ["every", 6.302, 6.602], ["lie", 6.615, 6.979], ["needs", 6.992, 7.383], ["another", 7.383, 7.695], ["lie", 7.708, 8.125]]}, {"text": "Then your parents get old. You sit next to them in the hospital, and the nurse thinks you're their grandson.", "start": 129.906, "end": 135.402, "spec": {"shot": "parents", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 25 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.104, 0.182], ["your", 0.182, 0.273], ["parents", 0.273, 0.625], ["get", 0.625, 0.768], ["old", 0.768, 1.094], ["You", 1.523, 1.602], ["sit", 1.602, 1.823], ["next", 1.836, 2.057], ["to", 2.057, 2.122], ["them", 2.122, 2.292], ["in", 2.292, 2.344], ["the", 2.344, 2.383], ["hospital", 2.396, 3.047], ["and", 3.49, 3.542], ["the", 3.542, 3.62], ["nurse", 3.62, 4.062], ["thinks", 4.076, 4.31], ["you're", 4.31, 4.388], ["their", 4.401, 4.518], ["grandson", 4.531, 5.104]]}, {"text": "At the funeral, people who have known you your whole life don't recognize you. They think you're some distant relative.", "start": 135.952, "end": 142.768, "spec": {"shot": "funeral", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 27 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.104, 0.195], ["the", 0.208, 0.286], ["funeral", 0.286, 0.951], ["people", 1.328, 1.628], ["who", 1.641, 1.732], ["have", 1.732, 1.849], ["known", 1.849, 2.135], ["you", 2.148, 2.279], ["your", 2.279, 2.409], ["whole", 2.409, 2.695], ["life", 2.695, 3.138], ["don't", 3.216, 3.464], ["recognize", 3.464, 4.049], ["you", 4.062, 4.284], ["They", 4.714, 4.805], ["think", 4.805, 4.987], ["you're", 5.0, 5.117], ["some", 5.117, 5.326], ["distant", 5.443, 5.833], ["relative", 5.833, 6.419]]}, {"text": "Love gets complicated too. You fall in love, but every year, your partner gets a little older, and you don't.", "start": 143.318, "end": 150.206, "spec": {"shot": "dating", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 30 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Love", 0.091, 0.286], ["gets", 0.286, 0.43], ["complicated", 0.43, 1.12], ["too", 1.133, 1.51], ["You", 1.927, 2.018], ["fall", 2.018, 2.266], ["in", 2.266, 2.357], ["love", 2.357, 2.786], ["but", 2.995, 3.164], ["every", 3.177, 3.464], ["year", 3.477, 3.945], ["your", 4.193, 4.284], ["partner", 4.297, 4.648], ["gets", 4.661, 4.818], ["a", 4.831, 4.87], ["little", 4.87, 5.234], ["older", 5.247, 5.716], ["and", 5.938, 6.016], ["you", 6.016, 6.107], ["don't", 6.107, 6.51]]}, {"text": "After twenty years, a waiter asks if she's your mom. Every time it happens, it hurts a little more.", "start": 150.756, "end": 157.5, "spec": {"shot": "motherson", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 45 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.104, 0.339], ["twenty", 0.339, 0.651], ["years", 0.651, 1.185], ["a", 1.576, 1.654], ["waiter", 1.654, 2.018], ["asks", 2.018, 2.552], ["if", 2.63, 2.721], ["she's", 2.721, 3.008], ["your", 3.008, 3.099], ["mom", 3.099, 3.451], ["Every", 3.867, 4.063], ["time", 4.076, 4.31], ["it", 4.31, 4.349], ["happens", 4.349, 4.948], ["it", 5.339, 5.417], ["hurts", 5.417, 5.664], ["a", 5.664, 5.703], ["little", 5.703, 5.925], ["more", 5.938, 6.367]]}, {"text": "Even normal life stops working. Your ID says you're fifty, but your face says twenty-five. Banks, doctors, employers. Everyone gets suspicious.", "start": 158.05, "end": 168.85, "spec": {"shot": "paperwork", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Even", 0.078, 0.273], ["normal", 0.273, 0.677], ["life", 0.677, 1.107], ["stops", 1.237, 1.641], ["working", 1.641, 2.044], ["Your", 2.461, 2.578], ["ID", 2.578, 3.047], ["says", 3.06, 3.32], ["you're", 3.32, 3.438], ["fifty", 3.451, 4.102], ["but", 4.336, 4.44], ["your", 4.453, 4.583], ["face", 4.596, 5.052], ["says", 5.065, 5.43], ["twenty-five", 5.43, 6.224], ["Banks", 6.654, 7.07], ["doctors", 7.188, 7.708], ["employers", 7.734, 8.555], ["Everyone", 8.971, 9.336], ["gets", 9.336, 9.492], ["suspicious", 9.492, 10.404]]}, {"text": "Try explaining to a doctor why your scans look twenty-five, when your file says you should be sixty.", "start": 169.4, "end": 176.024, "spec": {"shot": "doctor", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 60 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Try", 0.091, 0.286], ["explaining", 0.286, 0.703], ["to", 0.703, 0.82], ["a", 0.82, 0.885], ["doctor", 0.885, 1.458], ["why", 1.458, 1.771], ["your", 1.771, 1.914], ["scans", 1.927, 2.656], ["look", 2.76, 2.956], ["twenty-five", 2.969, 3.789], ["when", 4.206, 4.31], ["your", 4.31, 4.401], ["file", 4.414, 4.883], ["says", 4.896, 5.156], ["you", 5.156, 5.221], ["should", 5.234, 5.43], ["be", 5.43, 5.547], ["sixty", 5.56, 6.25]]}, {"text": "You start avoiding cameras. Every old photo of you is evidence. One picture from the past could expose everything.", "start": 176.574, "end": 184.062, "spec": {"shot": "photos", "era": "lounge", "chip": "YEAR 50 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.104, 0.169], ["start", 0.169, 0.417], ["avoiding", 0.43, 0.82], ["cameras", 0.833, 1.497], ["Every", 1.914, 2.201], ["old", 2.201, 2.396], ["photo", 2.409, 2.8], ["of", 2.8, 2.878], ["you", 2.878, 3.099], ["is", 3.268, 3.438], ["evidence", 3.451, 4.089], ["One", 4.518, 4.714], ["picture", 4.727, 5.065], ["from", 5.065, 5.169], ["the", 5.169, 5.247], ["past", 5.26, 5.755], ["could", 5.768, 5.898], ["expose", 5.898, 6.549], ["everything", 6.562, 7.109]]}, {"text": "So you do the only thing you can. You pack one suitcase, leave in the middle of the night, and start over in a new city with a new name.", "start": 184.612, "end": 193.036, "spec": {"shot": "move", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.104, 0.195], ["you", 0.208, 0.286], ["do", 0.299, 0.443], ["the", 0.443, 0.586], ["only", 0.599, 0.898], ["thing", 0.898, 1.263], ["you", 1.263, 1.367], ["can", 1.367, 1.823], ["You", 2.227, 2.318], ["pack", 2.318, 2.617], ["one", 2.617, 2.878], ["suitcase", 2.891, 3.75], ["leave", 4.05, 4.375], ["in", 4.375, 4.427], ["the", 4.427, 4.492], ["middle", 4.492, 4.766], ["of", 4.766, 4.831], ["the", 4.831, 4.896], ["night", 4.896, 5.273], ["and", 5.677, 5.781], ["start", 5.794, 6.133], ["over", 6.133, 6.445], ["in", 6.445, 6.536], ["a", 6.536, 6.562], ["new", 6.562, 6.901], ["city", 6.901, 7.279], ["with", 7.279, 7.448], ["a", 7.448, 7.474], ["new", 7.487, 7.708], ["name", 7.708, 8.047]]}, {"text": "No goodbyes. No explanations. Your friends just wake up one day, and you're gone.", "start": 193.586, "end": 199.298, "spec": {"shot": "burn", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 52 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["No", 0.104, 0.221], ["goodbyes", 0.234, 0.846], ["No", 1.276, 1.497], ["explanations", 1.51, 2.409], ["Your", 2.839, 2.93], ["friends", 2.93, 3.333], ["just", 3.333, 3.516], ["wake", 3.516, 3.711], ["up", 3.711, 3.867], ["one", 3.867, 4.089], ["day", 4.089, 4.479], ["and", 4.714, 4.831], ["you're", 4.844, 4.948], ["gone", 4.961, 5.313]]}, {"text": "And from far away, you watch the people you left behind get old, get sick, and die. And you're not allowed to be there.", "start": 199.848, "end": 207.24, "spec": {"shot": "faraway", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 70 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.169], ["from", 0.169, 0.312], ["far", 0.312, 0.638], ["away", 0.651, 1.12], ["you", 1.654, 1.758], ["watch", 1.758, 2.031], ["the", 2.031, 2.122], ["people", 2.122, 2.409], ["you", 2.409, 2.513], ["left", 2.513, 2.747], ["behind", 2.76, 3.203], ["get", 3.216, 3.372], ["old", 3.385, 3.802], ["get", 4.023, 4.18], ["sick", 4.18, 4.596], ["and", 4.596, 4.662], ["die", 4.675, 5.143], ["And", 5.56, 5.612], ["you're", 5.612, 5.69], ["not", 5.69, 5.859], ["allowed", 5.872, 6.315], ["to", 6.328, 6.432], ["be", 6.445, 6.628], ["there", 6.628, 7.005]]}, {"text": "And you have to do it again every ten or fifteen years. New city. New friends. New life. Again and again.", "start": 207.79, "end": 216.598, "spec": {"shot": "moves", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 100 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.169], ["you", 0.169, 0.247], ["have", 0.247, 0.378], ["to", 0.378, 0.456], ["do", 0.469, 0.677], ["it", 0.69, 0.729], ["again", 0.729, 1.133], ["every", 1.406, 1.706], ["ten", 1.706, 2.162], ["or", 2.383, 2.513], ["fifteen", 2.526, 3.086], ["years", 3.086, 3.607], ["New", 4.036, 4.206], ["city", 4.206, 4.648], ["New", 5.065, 5.234], ["friends", 5.234, 5.859], ["New", 6.289, 6.445], ["life", 6.445, 6.927], ["Again", 7.344, 7.786], ["and", 7.93, 8.008], ["again", 8.021, 8.424]]}, {"text": "After a while, you stop letting people in. What's the point of making friends if you'll have to leave them anyway?", "start": 217.148, "end": 223.46, "spec": {"shot": "walls", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 110 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["After", 0.104, 0.365], ["a", 0.365, 0.417], ["while", 0.417, 0.82], ["you", 1.341, 1.445], ["stop", 1.458, 1.797], ["letting", 1.81, 2.005], ["people", 2.005, 2.37], ["in", 2.383, 2.617], ["What's", 3.034, 3.151], ["the", 3.164, 3.255], ["point", 3.255, 3.529], ["of", 3.529, 3.607], ["making", 3.607, 3.932], ["friends", 3.932, 4.466], ["if", 4.557, 4.648], ["you'll", 4.648, 4.766], ["have", 4.766, 4.935], ["to", 4.935, 5.013], ["leave", 5.026, 5.286], ["them", 5.3, 5.417], ["anyway", 5.417, 5.951]]}, {"text": "You learn to fake it. You pretend to be tired. You pretend your back hurts. You even paint on a few wrinkles.", "start": 224.01, "end": 230.586, "spec": {"shot": "fake", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 115 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.104, 0.208], ["learn", 0.208, 0.417], ["to", 0.417, 0.482], ["fake", 0.482, 0.846], ["it", 0.846, 1.042], ["You", 1.471, 1.55], ["pretend", 1.562, 1.888], ["to", 1.888, 1.927], ["be", 1.927, 2.044], ["tired", 2.044, 2.526], ["You", 2.943, 2.995], ["pretend", 2.995, 3.307], ["your", 3.307, 3.372], ["back", 3.372, 3.633], ["hurts", 3.633, 4.102], ["You", 4.518, 4.596], ["even", 4.596, 4.818], ["paint", 4.818, 5.052], ["on", 5.052, 5.143], ["a", 5.143, 5.182], ["few", 5.182, 5.521], ["wrinkles", 5.521, 6.172]]}, {"text": "Every conversation is a test. Where did you grow up? Who are your parents? Why do you remember things nobody your age should know?", "start": 231.136, "end": 238.984, "spec": {"shot": "story", "era": "sad", "chip": "YEAR 120 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Every", 0.104, 0.326], ["conversation", 0.326, 1.094], ["is", 1.107, 1.263], ["a", 1.263, 1.315], ["test", 1.315, 1.862], ["Where", 2.279, 2.344], ["did", 2.344, 2.448], ["you", 2.448, 2.513], ["grow", 2.526, 2.799], ["up", 2.8, 2.995], ["Who", 3.438, 3.516], ["are", 3.529, 3.607], ["your", 3.607, 3.698], ["parents", 3.711, 4.31], ["Why", 4.74, 4.844], ["do", 4.844, 4.883], ["you", 4.883, 5.0], ["remember", 5.0, 5.326], ["things", 5.326, 5.651], ["nobody", 5.651, 6.068], ["your", 6.068, 6.302], ["age", 6.315, 6.732], ["should", 6.875, 7.109], ["know", 7.122, 7.461]]}, {"text": "And then something even worse shows up. Boredom. You've seen every kind of movie, heard every kind of song, had every kind of argument.", "start": 239.534, "end": 248.03, "spec": {"shot": "bored", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 150 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.104, 0.182], ["then", 0.182, 0.352], ["something", 0.365, 0.755], ["even", 0.768, 1.068], ["worse", 1.068, 1.51], ["shows", 1.523, 1.953], ["up", 1.966, 2.227], ["Boredom", 2.63, 2.995], ["You've", 3.411, 3.516], ["seen", 3.516, 3.841], ["every", 3.854, 4.115], ["kind", 4.115, 4.336], ["of", 4.336, 4.375], ["movie", 4.375, 4.883], ["heard", 5.104, 5.299], ["every", 5.417, 5.716], ["kind", 5.729, 5.924], ["of", 5.925, 5.99], ["song", 5.99, 6.445], ["had", 6.888, 6.979], ["every", 7.057, 7.305], ["kind", 7.305, 7.5], ["of", 7.5, 7.552], ["argument", 7.552, 8.112]]}, {"text": "Nothing surprises you anymore. And without surprises, even happiness starts to feel flat.", "start": 248.58, "end": 255.18, "spec": {"shot": "flat", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 160 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Nothing", 0.104, 0.352], ["surprises", 0.365, 0.924], ["you", 0.924, 1.055], ["anymore", 1.068, 1.589], ["And", 2.005, 2.122], ["without", 2.122, 2.435], ["surprises", 2.435, 3.242], ["even", 3.698, 3.945], ["happiness", 3.945, 4.661], ["starts", 4.831, 5.195], ["to", 5.195, 5.273], ["feel", 5.286, 5.677], ["flat", 5.69, 6.224]]}, {"text": "Your memories start to blur. One day you realize you can't remember the face of your first love anymore. Or your mother's voice.", "start": 255.73, "end": 263.866, "spec": {"shot": "forget", "era": "space", "chip": "YEAR 180 · LOOKS 25", "mood": "dark"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Your", 0.104, 0.208], ["memories", 0.208, 0.898], ["start", 1.042, 1.224], ["to", 1.224, 1.276], ["blur", 1.289, 1.784], ["One", 2.214, 2.409], ["day", 2.409, 2.604], ["you", 2.604, 2.799], ["realize", 2.8, 3.359], ["you", 3.359, 3.49], ["can't", 3.49, 3.841], ["remember", 3.854, 4.271], ["the", 4.271, 4.336], ["face", 4.349, 4.779], ["of", 4.779, 4.831], ["your", 4.831, 4.922], ["first", 4.935, 5.365], ["love", 5.365, 5.664], ["anymore", 5.677, 6.198], ["Or", 6.615, 6.68], ["your", 6.68, 6.771], ["mother's", 6.771, 7.096], ["voice", 7.096, 7.773]]}, {"text": "And hiding gets harder and harder. Cameras everywhere. Face recognition. Digital records of everything.", "start": 264.416, "end": 271.664, "spec": {"shot": "scan", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.169], ["hiding", 0.182, 0.495], ["gets", 0.495, 0.651], ["harder", 0.664, 1.185], ["and", 1.185, 1.25], ["harder", 1.25, 1.745], ["Cameras", 2.161, 2.669], ["everywhere", 2.8, 3.451], ["Face", 3.932, 4.18], ["recognition", 4.18, 4.844], ["Digital", 5.247, 5.729], ["records", 5.742, 6.237], ["of", 6.25, 6.341], ["everything", 6.354, 6.875]]}, {"text": "You know exactly what would happen if anyone found out. You wouldn't be a celebrity. You'd be a science experiment.", "start": 272.214, "end": 279.414, "spec": {"shot": "lab", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 200 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["You", 0.104, 0.169], ["know", 0.169, 0.299], ["exactly", 0.299, 0.938], ["what", 0.938, 1.068], ["would", 1.068, 1.185], ["happen", 1.185, 1.667], ["if", 1.992, 2.148], ["anyone", 2.292, 2.669], ["found", 2.669, 3.021], ["out", 3.034, 3.346], ["You", 3.763, 3.828], ["wouldn't", 3.841, 3.997], ["be", 3.997, 4.141], ["a", 4.141, 4.193], ["celebrity", 4.206, 4.857], ["You'd", 5.273, 5.378], ["be", 5.378, 5.482], ["a", 5.482, 5.534], ["science", 5.534, 6.068], ["experiment", 6.081, 6.81]]}, {"text": "So you carry the biggest secret in the world, completely alone. There's literally nobody you can tell.", "start": 279.964, "end": 286.612, "spec": {"shot": "secret", "era": "synth", "chip": "YEAR 220 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.104, 0.247], ["you", 0.247, 0.365], ["carry", 0.365, 0.716], ["the", 0.716, 0.859], ["biggest", 0.938, 1.393], ["secret", 1.406, 1.914], ["in", 1.927, 2.018], ["the", 2.018, 2.109], ["world", 2.109, 2.643], ["completely", 2.852, 3.49], ["alone", 3.503, 3.958], ["There's", 4.388, 4.557], ["literally", 4.57, 5.0], ["nobody", 5.0, 5.599], ["you", 5.599, 5.742], ["can", 5.755, 5.859], ["tell", 5.859, 6.276]]}, {"text": "Decades turn into centuries. Everyone you ever loved is gone. Only you remain.", "start": 287.162, "end": 293.138, "spec": {"shot": "gone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25", "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Decades", 0.091, 0.833], ["turn", 1.042, 1.367], ["into", 1.367, 1.536], ["centuries", 1.536, 2.422], ["Everyone", 2.839, 3.164], ["you", 3.164, 3.294], ["ever", 3.294, 3.594], ["loved", 3.594, 3.893], ["is", 3.893, 3.997], ["gone", 3.997, 4.375], ["Only", 4.805, 5.013], ["you", 5.013, 5.156], ["remain", 5.156, 5.573]]}, {"text": "Sure, that little investment has turned into a fortune by now. But there's nobody left to spend it with.", "start": 293.688, "end": 300.36, "spec": {"shot": "fortune", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Sure", 0.104, 0.508], ["that", 0.964, 1.198], ["little", 1.211, 1.419], ["investment", 1.419, 2.109], ["has", 2.122, 2.318], ["turned", 2.318, 2.63], ["into", 2.643, 2.839], ["a", 2.839, 2.904], ["fortune", 2.904, 3.438], ["by", 3.451, 3.607], ["now", 3.62, 4.115], ["But", 4.557, 4.635], ["there's", 4.635, 4.779], ["nobody", 4.779, 5.117], ["left", 5.117, 5.443], ["to", 5.456, 5.521], ["spend", 5.534, 5.872], ["it", 5.872, 5.937], ["with", 5.938, 6.289]]}, {"text": "And you start to envy them. The people who got old. They got a whole story, with a beginning, a middle, and an end.", "start": 300.91, "end": 308.47, "spec": {"shot": "envyold", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "YEAR 500 · LOOKS 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.104, 0.169], ["you", 0.169, 0.234], ["start", 0.247, 0.469], ["to", 0.469, 0.534], ["envy", 0.534, 0.833], ["them", 0.846, 1.094], ["The", 1.536, 1.589], ["people", 1.589, 1.875], ["who", 1.875, 1.966], ["got", 1.979, 2.161], ["old", 2.175, 2.487], ["They", 2.904, 2.969], ["got", 2.969, 3.099], ["a", 3.112, 3.138], ["whole", 3.138, 3.503], ["story", 3.503, 4.089], ["with", 4.375, 4.531], ["a", 4.531, 4.583], ["beginning", 4.583, 5.13], ["a", 5.378, 5.417], ["middle", 5.43, 6.003], ["and", 6.536, 6.641], ["an", 6.641, 6.745], ["end", 6.758, 7.174]]}, {"text": "In roughly a billion years, scientists expect the Sun to be so bright that Earth becomes too hot for life.", "start": 309.02, "end": 316.052, "spec": {"shot": "hotearth", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~1 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.091, 0.221], ["roughly", 0.221, 0.534], ["a", 0.534, 0.599], ["billion", 0.599, 0.964], ["years", 0.964, 1.471], ["scientists", 1.719, 2.305], ["expect", 2.305, 2.708], ["the", 2.708, 2.786], ["Sun", 2.786, 3.06], ["to", 3.06, 3.138], ["be", 3.138, 3.268], ["so", 3.281, 3.62], ["bright", 3.633, 4.154], ["that", 4.297, 4.518], ["Earth", 4.661, 4.909], ["becomes", 4.922, 5.417], ["too", 5.417, 5.677], ["hot", 5.677, 5.99], ["for", 5.99, 6.159], ["life", 6.159, 6.654]]}, {"text": "And in about five billion years, the Sun swells into a red giant.", "start": 316.602, "end": 321.594, "spec": {"shot": "redgiant", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "~5 BILLION YEARS"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.104, 0.169], ["in", 0.169, 0.234], ["about", 0.234, 0.521], ["five", 0.534, 1.003], ["billion", 1.003, 1.354], ["years", 1.354, 1.914], ["the", 2.135, 2.266], ["Sun", 2.266, 2.643], ["swells", 2.656, 3.333], ["into", 3.398, 3.659], ["a", 3.659, 3.737], ["red", 3.737, 4.128], ["giant", 4.128, 4.622]]}, {"text": "And you? You're still twenty-five.", "start": 322.144, "end": 324.64, "spec": {"shot": "alone", "era": "cosmic", "chip": "AGE 25"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.104, 0.221], ["you", 0.234, 0.495], ["You're", 0.911, 1.003], ["still", 1.003, 1.302], ["twenty-five", 1.302, 2.096]]}, {"text": "Maybe getting older isn't a bug. Maybe it's exactly what makes our time so valuable. Every birthday, every goodbye, every moment matters, because it doesn't last forever.", "start": 325.19, "end": 336.902, "spec": {"shot": "meaning", "era": "wonder", "chip": null, "cut": true}, "afx": null, "words": [["Maybe", 0.104, 0.326], ["getting", 0.339, 0.599], ["older", 0.612, 1.094], ["isn't", 1.25, 1.458], ["a", 1.458, 1.484], ["bug", 1.484, 1.901], ["Maybe", 2.331, 2.552], ["it's", 2.552, 2.656], ["exactly", 2.656, 3.255], ["what", 3.255, 3.411], ["makes", 3.425, 3.75], ["our", 3.763, 3.906], ["time", 3.919, 4.362], ["so", 4.518, 4.766], ["valuable", 4.766, 5.443], ["Every", 5.872, 6.12], ["birthday", 6.12, 6.862], ["every", 7.148, 7.409], ["goodbye", 7.409, 8.06], ["every", 8.581, 8.867], ["moment", 8.88, 9.284], ["matters", 9.284, 9.701], ["because", 9.727, 9.974], ["it", 9.974, 10.052], ["doesn't", 10.052, 10.326], ["last", 10.326, 10.677], ["forever", 10.677, 11.328]]}, {"text": "So, would you still take the deal? Living forever, but watching everyone you love leave?", "start": 337.452, "end": 343.572, "spec": {"shot": "deal", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.104, 0.469], ["would", 0.599, 0.716], ["you", 0.716, 0.781], ["still", 0.781, 0.99], ["take", 0.99, 1.159], ["the", 1.159, 1.224], ["deal", 1.224, 1.589], ["Living", 1.992, 2.331], ["forever", 2.331, 3.125], ["but", 3.594, 3.763], ["watching", 3.776, 4.271], ["everyone", 4.375, 4.779], ["you", 4.779, 4.896], ["love", 4.909, 5.234], ["leave", 5.234, 5.729]]}, {"text": "Tell me in the comments. And if you want more what-if stories like this, subscribe.", "start": 344.122, "end": 348.586, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "era": "wonder", "chip": null}, "afx": null, "words": [["Tell", 0.104, 0.234], ["me", 0.234, 0.391], ["in", 0.391, 0.456], ["the", 0.456, 0.521], ["comments", 0.521, 1.185], ["And", 1.615, 1.68], ["if", 1.693, 1.771], ["you", 1.771, 1.836], ["want", 1.836, 1.953], ["more", 1.953, 2.135], ["what-if", 2.135, 2.565], ["stories", 2.565, 2.995], ["like", 2.995, 3.177], ["this", 3.177, 3.411], ["subscribe", 3.425, 4.089]]}], "dur": 351.59}